  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you throw down a default plane and put mirror reflection on it, it will change the shader of the standard material. You can fix this by setting the custom shader to the standard shader, but if someone doesn't know this they could very easily break their project if they wanted to use that material elsewhere. This seems like something a script shouldn't be able to do....",
